    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Bob Achila, a faculty member, Department of Obstetrics and Gynaecology at AKU Medical College, East Africa has become the first doctor in Kenya to receive subspecialist recognition in the field of urogynaecology from the Kenya Medical Practitioners and Dentists Council (KMPDC).",
